{"title":"The Brain Rot cinematic universe: John Pork vs Bombardiro Crocodilo","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/john-pork-bombardiro-crocodilo-tralalero-tralala-italian-brainrot-instagram-reels-ai-slop-storytelling-explained","date":1745947281000,"content":"<p><em><strong>The following is a deeply reported look into a growing phenomenon on Instagram Reels. To unlock more of my deep dives into emerging online spaces and internet trends, and to keep this newsletter alive, <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe\">become a paid subscriber today</a>. </strong></em></p><p><em><strong>I cannot produce this newsletter without your financial support! <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe\">Your money goes directly towards reporting costs</a>.</strong></em></p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\" width=\"1407\" height=\"27\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IcXJ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d942a60-0a17-45e9-92a5-46ecaaee6c94_2560x1440.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IcXJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d942a60-0a17-45e9-92a5-46ecaaee6c94_2560x1440.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IcXJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d942a60-0a17-45e9-92a5-46ecaaee6c94_2560x1440.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IcXJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d942a60-0a17-45e9-92a5-46ecaaee6c94_2560x1440.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IcXJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d942a60-0a17-45e9-92a5-46ecaaee6c94_2560x1440.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IcXJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6d942a60-0a17-45e9-92a5-46ecaaee6c94_2560x1440.jpeg 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>AI characters from the Instagram Reels cinematic universe</figcaption></figure></div><p>Right now, there's <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DHwng-PgUwf/\">an epic story playing out across Instagram Reels</a>. John Pork, a virtual influencer with a pig's head on a human body, was allegedly murdered by Tim Cheese, an AI-generated rat who was once Pork's best friend. The murder was witnessed by Pingu, the animated penguin who starred in a Swiss children's show in the 90s. Simon Claw, an AI-generated cat, may have aided in the killing, while Marvin Beak, a war-hardened bird and former assassin, was hired to avenge John’s death.</p><p>Videos telling this story, piece by piece, are amassing tens of millions of collective views across Instagram Reels. The story has become so popular that it has spurred <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@darraghomurchu/video/7477713941834124566\">IRL meetups</a> and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@darraghomurchu/video/7489840647709510934\">marches in Europe</a>. It has expanded into a sprawling, fantastical tale with frequent pivots and cliffhangers. Reels users have developed and introduced a <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DH0b9eBJdoa/\">slew of new characters</a> into the John Pork universe, including <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DHyOBBNOCdk\">Tina Cheese</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DHttJvgSeFZ\">Bob Bacon</a>, and Agent 5.5. Each character has a detailed backstory and role in the larger narrative.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oD6-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4527c17-16d0-4ae5-9023-631c8889f058_656x210.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oD6-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4527c17-16d0-4ae5-9023-631c8889f058_656x210.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"156.21951219512195\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oD6-!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4527c17-16d0-4ae5-9023-631c8889f058_656x210.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oD6-!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4527c17-16d0-4ae5-9023-631c8889f058_656x210.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oD6-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4527c17-16d0-4ae5-9023-631c8889f058_656x210.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oD6-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4527c17-16d0-4ae5-9023-631c8889f058_656x210.png 1456w\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>​The rise of John Pork lore, which has recently crossed over into the Italian Brainrot cinematic universe, exemplifies a transformative shift in media, where decentralized, AI-driven storytelling is reshaping the online entertainment landscape.​ Users are leveraging easily-accessible AI image and video generation tools to produce videos, images, and narratives that collectively <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DINol0Ugq_S/\">build out complex stories around different characters</a> to move a plot forward.</p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/john-pork-bombardiro-crocodilo-tralalero-tralala-italian-brainrot-instagram-reels-ai-slop-storytelling-explained\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"4cd450b3585f2dcfe25868471406eb2fd56340e7ccffbade603432c69d3b495a","category":"Sites"}